{"game": "helldivers-2", "language": "spanish", "appid": 553850, "month": "2024-09", "window": 3, "start_date": 1726444800, "end_date": 1727135999, "month_true_total": 278, "quota": 5, "returned": 5, "pulled_at": "2026-08-29 22:31:28 Pacific Daylight Time", "reviews": [{"recommendationid": "175643170", "author": {"steamid": "76561198319350286", "personaname": "MrFlus", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198319350286/", "num_games_owned": 250, "num_reviews": 3, "playtime_forever": 3513, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 3110, "last_played": 1782296480, "avatar": "3017f64da039e05834f718537fc1fba48efe92e6"}, "language": "spanish", "review": "Juego increíble, si lo que buscas es pasar el rato jugando unas partidas tienes la diversión asegurada, algunas dificultades pueden ser estresantes pero siempre puede bajar la dificultada y desahogarte en niveles bajos. Lo recomiendo si te gustan los juegos de disparos a números de enemigo muy numerosos.", "timestamp_created": 1727129206, "timestamp_updated": 1727129206, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1707382200", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "175642055", "author": {"steamid": "76561199002782790", "personaname": "Caricatura", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561199002782790/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 5, "playtime_forever": 3916, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 356, "last_played": 1774659525, "avatar": "cde80f50ba4fa74abbd3f7b2b44354ef8e3b1685"}, "language": "spanish", "review": "Honestamente el juego es increible se ve demasiado divertido para jugar con amigos una infinidad de horas, lamentablemente el sistema online es horrible (O al menos lo es 